{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strinova is an anime-style third-person tactical competitive shooter. Switch freely between three-dimensional and two-dimensional forms in this one-of-a-kind game that offers a unique tactical shooting system for an unparalleled experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multidimensional Shooter Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the multi-dimensional world of Strinova, seamlessly switch between 2D and 3D forms to explore different movement routes and combat strategies, delivering a unique shooting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/240419_ST_EN_P616x172_info_01.gif?t=1745027527\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/String_dogde.gif?t=1745027527\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Tactical Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strinova features multilayered maps, stringification mechanism, tactical skill operations, and a variety of useable devices, forming a unique team combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/Season2_BP_gif.gif?t=1745027527\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ever-increasing Maps and Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various maps bring numerous game modes, including Demolition and Team Deathmatch. More maps and game modes will be added in the future. Anticipate fighting alongside your teammates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/240419_ST_EN_P616x172_info_03.gif?t=1745027527\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Superstrings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Their unique skills and firearms make every Superstring irreplaceable. Whether you are an attacker breaking through enemy lines or a guardian protecting your teammates, you will find your place to shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/240419_ST_EN_P616x172_info_04.gif?t=1745027527\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1282270?t=1745027527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745027527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/619af9384afcde0cc5d7b391d938509aec301023/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745027527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/619af9384afcde0cc5d7b391d938509aec301023/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745027527","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1282270/extras/2.18_roadmap_-_en.png?t=1745027527\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strinova is an anime-style third-person tactical competitive shooter. Switch freely between three-dimensional and two-dimensional forms in this one-of-a-kind game that offers a unique tactical shooting system for an unparalleled experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_t